<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Awaiting Admin Approval</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f9fafb; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100vh;">

  <div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); max-width: 500px; width: 90%; text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="color: #5b21b6; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 10px;">⏳ Awaiting Admin Approval</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 17px; color: #4b5563;">We've received your payment request. An admin is reviewing it now.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 10px;">You will be redirected once your payment is confirmed.</p>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border: 4px solid #a78bfa; border-top: 4px solid transparent; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; margin: auto;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    @keyframes spin {
      from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
